@startuml sequence_uc4_stats
title UC-4: Перегляд статистики (GET /api/stats)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Клієнт" as C
participant "ApiServer [request_pool]" as A
participant SearchService as S
C -> A : GET /api/stats
A -> S : Stats() [index_mutex_]
S --> A : IndexStats
A --> C : 200 {"documents", "index_build_time_ms", "threads_used"}
note right of S : до першої індексації — нулі
@enduml
